{"id":"c68b36d66d7486d0","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-pcp-compatible-prefixes.md","title":"PCP 的相容前缀与严格部分解","display":"df-pcp-compatible-prefixes — PCP 的相容前缀与严格部分解","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-pcp-compatible-prefixes","aliases":["73-df-pcp-compatible-prefixes"],"display":"df-pcp-compatible-prefixes — PCP 的相容前缀与严格部分解","depends_on":["[[73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§9.4.1–9.4.2 boxed discussion, print p. 404; PDF p. 426; equality boundary made explicit","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":9},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-pcp-compatible-prefixes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-pcp-compatible-prefixes</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pcp-compatible-prefixes — PCP 的相容前缀与严格部分解"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef2510d5b7c48e0c\" href=\"?note=ef2510d5b7c48e0c\" title=\"73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions\">73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.4.1–9.4.2 boxed discussion, print p. 404; PDF p. 426; equality boundary made explicit"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in(\\Sigma^+\\times\\Sigma^+)^k\">\\(I\\in(\\Sigma^+\\times\\Sigma^+)^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_I,V_I\">\\(U_I,V_I\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef2510d5b7c48e0c\" href=\"?note=ef2510d5b7c48e0c\" title=\"73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions\">73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions</a> 中该同一实例的两个串接函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Compatible}_I(\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;U_I(\\iota)z=V_I(\\iota))\\lor\n(\\exists z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;V_I(\\iota)z=U_I(\\iota)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Compatible}_I(\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;U_I(\\iota)z=V_I(\\iota))\\lor\n(\\exists z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;V_I(\\iota)z=U_I(\\iota)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StrictPartial}_I(\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Compatible}_I(\\iota)\\land U_I(\\iota)\\ne V_I(\\iota).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StrictPartial}_I(\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Compatible}_I(\\iota)\\land U_I(\\iota)\\ne V_I(\\iota).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>相容允许已经相等；严格部分解排除相等。完整解的某个真前缀也可能已经是一个较短完整解，因此不能说每个真前缀都必须是“严格”部分解。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions","status":"resolved","id":"ef2510d5b7c48e0c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions","status":"resolved","id":"ef2510d5b7c48e0c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$I\\in(\\Sigma^+\\times\\Sigma^+)^k$，$\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{<\\omega}$。$U_I,V_I$ 采用 [[73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions]] 中该同一实例的两个串接函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in(\\Sigma^+\\times\\Sigma^+)^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"U_I,V_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Compatible}_I(\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;U_I(\\iota)z=V_I(\\iota))\\lor\n(\\exists z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;V_I(\\iota)z=U_I(\\iota)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StrictPartial}_I(\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Compatible}_I(\\iota)\\land U_I(\\iota)\\ne V_I(\\iota).","display":true}],"bytes":1535,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-206","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-pcp-compatible-prefixes|PCP 的相容前缀与严格部分解]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"f2f999bbeb3c1da6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["ef2510d5b7c48e0c"]}